{"sha": "4226a59601c450bcb755177f41661f81d70272e0aaf3872ba5be0adee5dc3747", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}[能斯特方程的推导]\\label{thm:b2:cell-thermodynamics:nernst-derived}", "对于半反应 $\\alpha\\,\\mathrm{Ox} + n\\,\\mathrm e^- \\rightleftharpoons", "\\beta\\,\\mathrm{Red}$，电极在温度 $T$ 下的电势为", "\\[", "  E = E^\\circ + \\frac{RT}{nF}\\ln\\frac{a_{\\mathrm{Ox}}^{\\alpha}}{a_{\\mathrm{Red}}^{\\beta}} ,", "\\]", "式中的活度包括半反应中其余各物种的活度", "（\\ce{H+} 计入，水除外），各以其化学计量数为指数。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "电极的电势是由标准", "氢电极（阳极）与该电极（阴极）组成的电池的电压，其反应为", "\\[", "  \\alpha\\,\\mathrm{Ox} + \\tfrac n2\\,\\ce{H2} \\longrightarrow \\beta\\,\\mathrm{Red} + n\\,\\ce{H+} ,", "\\]", "其反应商中，在标准氢电极处取 $a_{\\ce{H+}} = 1$、$p_{\\ce{H2}} = p^\\circ$，", "反应商化简为 $a_{\\mathrm{Red}}^\\beta/", "a_{\\mathrm{Ox}}^\\alpha$。由\\cref{thm:b2:cell-thermodynamics:delta-g-nfe}，", "$E = -\\Delta_r G/(nF) = -\\Delta_r G^\\circ/(nF) - (RT/nF)\\ln Q$；取 $E^\\circ =", "-\\Delta_r G^\\circ/(nF)$，即得上式。在 \\qty{298.15}{K} 下，$RT\\ln 10/F =", "\\qty{0.0592}{V}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[由吉布斯自由能求标准电极电势]\\label{prop:b2:cell-thermodynamics:standard-potential}", "约定 $\\Delta_f G^\\circ(\\ce{H+}, \\text{aq}) = 0$ 且", "$\\Delta_f G^\\circ(\\ce{H2}, \\text{g}) = 0$，则电对的标准电极电势为", "$E^\\circ = -\\Delta_r G^\\circ/(nF)$，其中 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ$ 为按还原方向书写的", "半反应的标准吉布斯自由能，并将电子的", "吉布斯自由能取为零。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在与氢电极构成的反应中，$\\tfrac n2\\,\\ce{H2}$ 与", "$n\\,\\ce{H+}$ 在上述约定下对 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ$ 均无贡献：", "故电池反应的标准吉布斯自由能即为该半反应的标准吉布斯自由能。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[由数据表求标准电极电势]\\label{met:b2:cell-thermodynamics:e-from-gibbs}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将半反应按还原方向书写，用 \\ce{H+} 和", "        \\ce{H2O} 配平，电子数为 $n$。", "  \\item 计算 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ = \\sum\\nu_i\\Delta_f G^\\circ_i$（生成物", "        取正号），单质、\\ce{H+} 和电子的取值均为零。", "  \\item $E^\\circ = -\\Delta_r G^\\circ/(nF)$，单位为伏特，$\\Delta_r G^\\circ$ 的单位为", "        焦耳每摩尔。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[氯化银电极]\\label{ex:b2:cell-thermodynamics:agcl}", "\\ce{AgCl(s) + e- -> Ag(s) + Cl^-}：$\\Delta_r G^\\circ = -131.228 - (-109.789) =", "\\qty{-21.439}{kJ/mol}$，$E^\\circ = 21\\,439/96\\,485 = \\qty{0.222}{V}$。其电势", "仅取决于氯离子活度：在饱和氯化钾", "溶液中，它是稳定的参比电极。", "% ledger: dfg:Cl-_ao, dfg:AgCl_cr", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[电极电势的组合]\\label{prop:b2:cell-thermodynamics:combining}", "若半反应 (3)（电子数为 $n_3$）是半反应 (1)", "与半反应 (2) 之和（电子数分别为 $n_1$ 和 $n_2$），则", "\\[", "  n_3E_3^\\circ = n_1E_1^\\circ + n_2E_2^\\circ ;", "\\]", "电势本身不可相加。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "标准吉布斯自由能可加，即 $\\Delta_r G_3^\\circ = \\Delta_r G_1^\\circ + \\Delta_r", "G_2^\\circ$，电子数亦相加，$n_3 = n_1 + n_2$。将各 $\\Delta_r", "G^\\circ$ 除以 $-F$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[铁的两种氧化态]\\label{ex:b2:cell-thermodynamics:iron}", "\\ce{Fe^3+ + e- -> Fe^2+} 的 $E^\\circ = (-78.90 + 4.7)/(-96.485) = \\qty{0.77}{V}$，", "而 \\ce{Fe^2+ + 2e- -> Fe} 的 $E^\\circ = -78.90/(2 \\times 96.485) =", "\\qty{-0.41}{V}$。由此 \\ce{Fe^3+ + 3e- -> Fe}：$E^\\circ = (0.77 - 0.82)/3 =", "\\qty{-0.02}{V}$，并非两者之和。", "% ledger: dfg:Fe2+_ao, dfg:Fe3+_ao", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{温度、熵与燃料电池的效率}", "", "\\begin{definition}[温度系数]\\label{def:b2:cell-thermodynamics:temperature-coefficient}", "称电池的\\emph{温度系数}\\index{温度系数}为", "其电动势对温度的导数", "$(\\partial E/\\partial T)_p$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[由电池数据求熵与焓]\\label{prop:b2:cell-thermodynamics:entropy}", "对于标准电池反应，", "\\[", "  \\Delta_r S^\\circ = nF\\,\\frac{dE^\\circ}{dT}, \\qquad", "  \\Delta_r H^\\circ = -nF\\Big(E^\\circ - T\\frac{dE^\\circ}{dT}\\Big),", "\\]", "且电池在温度 $T$ 下可逆工作时，", "自外界吸收的热量为每摩尔反应 $T\\Delta_r S$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\Delta_r S^\\circ = -d\\Delta_r G^\\circ/dT$（由 $dG = -S\\,dT + V\\,dp$，对", "$\\xi$ 求导）$= nF\\,dE^\\circ/dT$；再由 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ = \\Delta_r G^\\circ", "+ T\\Delta_r S^\\circ$。对可逆变化，$\\delta Q = T\\,dS = T\\Delta_r S\\,", "d\\xi$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[由电池数据求反应的热力学量]\\label{met:b2:cell-thermodynamics:cell-data}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在若干温度下测量 $E$；斜率即为 $dE/dT$。", "  \\item $\\Delta_r G = -nFE$，$\\Delta_r S = nF\\,dE/dT$，$\\Delta_r H = \\Delta_r G +", "        T\\Delta_r S$。", "  \\item 电池可逆工作时，每摩尔交换的热量为 $T\\Delta_r S$；", "        若电池以电压 $U < E$ 输出电流，则释放的热量为", "        每摩尔 $-\\Delta_r H - nFU$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}